Its complex Fourier series is:f(x) = \frac{4}{\pi} \sum_{n=1,3,5,\ldots}^{\infty} \frac{1}{n} \sin(n\omega x)
= -\frac{2i}{\pi}
\sum_{\substack{n=-\infty\\ n\ \mathrm{odd}}}^{\infty}
\frac{e^{in\omega x}}{n}.

