Estimate magnitude:\left| \int_{\text{semicircle}} \frac{dz}{z^2 + 1} \right|
\leq\int_0^\pi\frac{R\,d\theta}{R^2-1}
=\frac{\pi R}{R^2-1}
\longrightarrow0
\qquad(R\to\infty).

Conclusion: Semicircle does not contribute in the limit R \to \infty.

